OL,3,ASchools close early for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of schools have closed early
OL,7,Famid safety concerns over a funeral
OL,8,Flinked to a crash which killed seven
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FThe funeral of Jakub Matusiak, 23, one
OL,12,Fof five young men killed in the head-on
OL,13,Fcollision with a marked police car on
OL,14,Fthe A66, has been held near
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
